  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 104.33 Residual waste",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 104.33 “Residual waste” means solid waste remaining after processing, treatment, or disposal of solid waste or as a by-product of processing or treatment or disposal of solid waste, including leachate, decomposition gases, and waste-derived products not certified for distribution and use pursuant to Env-Sw 1500. The term includes “residuals.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 104.27) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
